+++ b/readme.txt
@@ -126,7 +126,7 @@ An extensive knowledge base is available on our [website](https://www.wp-slimsta
 == Upgrade Notice ==
 
 = 6.0.0 =
-SlimStat 6 adds heatmaps, WooCommerce revenue, campaign channels and faster reports. Back up first. The update adds columns and indexes and removes no rows; older versions keep working and the added columns stay. Database steps wait for your click. Some totals change on purpose: see changelog.
+SlimStat 6 adds heatmaps, WooCommerce revenue, campaign channels and faster reports. Back up first. The update adds columns and indexes and removes no rows; older versions keep working and the added columns stay. Database steps wait for your click. Some totals change on purpose: see changelog. Read the full release notes and review every migration step on wordpress.org before you begin this update. Keep a separate backup for recovery.
 
 
